{
  "schema": "needletail.scale.phases.v1",
  "description": "The proving run of the resilient mesh on Linode, its changes (deploy/low-latency/SCALE.md \"The proving run\", step 6), on deploy/low-latency/topology-proving.json (three serving edges and one standby a region, two forwarders and a dist-c slot, two contributors, a view and a nano probe host a region). Two real runs of each change, not ten (the 10-of-10 gate is the local proof's): group C1 is run 1 (F1 the faults and the autoscaler's verbs, R1 the rolls from set a to set b), group C2 run 2 (F2 the faults on other nodes and a slot edge joining, R2 the rolls back to set a). Each scenario is ONE shared probe (\"probe\": \"shared\"): its changes one after another, each its own label (span_s: the label's planned length, holds included), at least 30 s apart once widened by the referee's 2 s and 5 s, and the probe run on until every label's length has 150 no-change windows outside every label (scale-run shared_probe_tail). Scored by the referee's change-window.py WITH its shared-probe patch (.resilient/reports/proving-change-window-shared-probe.patch: each label's null taken outside every label of the probe); without it a shared probe is not sound. Probes on opus-1 and pcm-1 (probe_configs) on every view and nano host; the crowd 480 listeners (120 a region, two paths). scale-run.py run --phase-plan deploy/low-latency/phases-proving.json --group C1 --name prove-c1 --budget-usd 100 --spent-before-usd 63.48 --next-av-mesh-root <set b av-mesh> --next-av-contrib-root <set b av-contrib>; then --group C2 --name prove-c2. C1 65.0 minutes, C2 52.0 (scale-run plan --topology-only), within the one lab: up creates 45 nodes at $3.510 an hour (53 at $3.942 with every slot; ceilings NEEDLETAIL_LINODE_MAX_NODES=53 and NEEDLETAIL_LINODE_MAX_HOURLY_USD=3.95), up to down about 4 h 15 min, 5 billed hours, $17.55 ($14.04 without Sydney), the watchdog at 5 h. A site the lab was made without is left out of the shared probes (its rolls). Engine timeouts on every gated command: gate 10 s, drain 15 s, readiness 30 s.",
  "defaults": {
    "config": "opus-1",
    "probe_configs": "opus-1,pcm-1",
    "listeners": 480,
    "hls_share": 0.02,
    "baseline_s": 60,
    "observe_s": 60,
    "settle_s": 30
  },
  "groups": {
    "C1": {
      "listeners": 480
    },
    "C2": {
      "listeners": 480
    }
  },
