      "title": "faults, run 1, one probe: drain and resume lon-edge-1; kill lon-edge-2 and start it 20 s later; kill the forwarder tok-dist-a and start it; the ingress lon-dist-a killed and returned (A's kill, held down, and return); contrib-lon killed and returned (the standby contrib-lon-b carries the stream); the autoscaler's scale up London (the standby edge lon-edge-4 joins), scale up again (no standby left: the slot lon-edge-5 is created, the one real create), and scale down twice (the warm pool keeps the drained slot stopped)",
      "actions": [
